            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Workspaces and previews

- Claude Code and local Cursor sessions can get named worktrees automatically and reuse them when resumed.
- Running projects show a 16:9 preview in Overview. Hover over it and click to open it in your browser.
- Grok Bot avatars use the roster’s shapes and colors, with support for older Grok Bot versions.

## Setup and checks

- Agent tools puts the connection action next to the tool it controls.
- Weft handles more check-runner setup cases and discovers preview URLs from running services.
]]></description>
